    "id": "f2de55db3a40e0e7",
    "title": "Traders claim $6 million profit by spotting BitGo’s public pull request and frontrunning memecoin listing",
    "summary": "A public BitGo code change on July 27 added support for Cash Cat on Robinhood Chain ten days before Robinhood announced the listing.",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://www.theblock.co/news/defi/2026-11-15-traders-claim-6-million-profit-by-spotting-bitgos-public-pull-request-and-frontrunning-memecoin-listing-440363",
    "source": "The Block",
    "tags": [
      "BitGo",
